Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:15:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] EvalMod: degree-27 series with 4 double angles (9 levels
 instead of 10)

Dense/ENCAPS (K=16): degree-27 whole-interval minimax, 43.5 bits (was degree 14 + 5
double angles, 27.4 bits). SparseB (K=24): degree 27 + 4 double angles, 28.2 bits
(was degree 20 + 5, 35.2 bits). EVALMOD_LEVELS 10 -> 9. pc-shadow example em_depth
measures the levels an EvalMod series consumes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
